WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.370
Tafuta thamani ya x na hakiki jibu lako.

00:03.370 --> 00:07.920
Tuna x gawanya kwa 3 ni sawa na 14.

00:07.920 --> 00:11.320
Hivyo kutafuta thamani ya x, kujua mtajo x ni

00:11.320 --> 00:14.135
sawa na ngapi, tunatakiwa tuitenge

00:14.135 --> 00:15.760
upande wa kushoto wa mlinganyo huu.

00:15.760 --> 00:16.884
Tayari ziko hapa.

00:16.884 --> 00:19.490
Tuna x gawanya kwa 3 ni sawa na 14.

00:19.490 --> 00:24.960
Tunaweza pia kuiandika hii kama 1/3 x ni sawa na 14.

00:24.960 --> 00:27.730
Ni wazi, x mara 1/3 ni sawa na x/3.

00:27.730 --> 00:28.840
Hizi ni sawa.

00:28.840 --> 00:31.800
Hivyo tunawezaje kuishia na x upande wa kushoto

00:31.800 --> 00:33.107
wa mojawapo ya milinganyo hii?

00:33.107 --> 00:34.440
Hizi ni kitu kile kile.

00:34.440 --> 00:36.370
Au njia nyingine, tunawezaje kuwa na 1

00:36.370 --> 00:38.990
mbele ya x, 1x, ambayo ni kusema

00:38.990 --> 00:40.650
x hapa?

00:40.650 --> 00:42.860
Nagawanya kwa 3 sasa.

00:42.860 --> 00:46.420
Kwa hiyo kama nikizidisha pande zote za mlinganyo huu kwa 3,

00:46.420 --> 00:47.680
hiyo itaitenga x

00:47.680 --> 00:50.100
Na sababu hiyo itafanya kazi nikizidisha

00:50.100 --> 00:54.140
kwa 3 hapa, nazidisha kwa 3 na kugawanya kwa 3.

00:54.140 --> 00:55.310
Hizo ni sawa.

00:55.310 --> 00:57.720
Hiyo ni sawa na kuzidisha au kugawanya kwa 1.

00:57.720 --> 00:58.995
Hizi zinaisha.

00:58.995 --> 01:00.870
Kumbuka, kama ukifanya upande wa kushoto,

01:00.870 --> 01:03.004
pia unatakiwa ufanye upande wa kulia.

01:03.004 --> 01:04.879
Na nitafanya kwa milinganyo yote hii miwili

01:04.879 --> 01:06.545
katika muda mmoja, kwa sababu

01:06.545 --> 01:08.470
ni mlinganyo ule ule.

01:08.470 --> 01:10.970
Kwa hiyo tutapata nini hapa upande wa kushoto?

01:10.970 --> 01:15.350
3 mara chochote gawanya kwa 3 ni sawa na hicho chochote.

01:15.350 --> 01:17.580
Tutabakiwa na x hapa

01:17.580 --> 01:19.050
upande wa kushoto.

01:19.050 --> 01:22.100
Na upande wa kulia, ni nini 14 mara 3?

01:22.100 --> 01:27.770
3 mara 10 ni 30, 3 mara 4 ni 12.

01:27.770 --> 01:29.510
Kwa hiyo itakuwa 42.

01:29.510 --> 01:31.550
Kwa hiyo tunapata x ni sawa na 42.

01:31.550 --> 01:33.120
N akitu kile kile kitatokea hapa.

01:33.120 --> 01:36.250
3 mara 1/3 ni 1

01:36.250 --> 01:39.820
Kwa hiyo unapata 1x ni sawa na 14 mara 3, ambayo ni 42.

01:39.820 --> 01:41.250
Sasa hebu tuhakiki jibu letu.

01:41.250 --> 01:44.060
Hebu tuweke 42 kwenye mlinganyo wetu.

01:44.060 --> 01:52.190
Kwa hiyo tuna 42 katika sehemu ya x juu ya 3 ni sawa na 14.

01:52.190 --> 01:54.370
Kwa hiyo 42 gawanya kwa 3 ni ngapi?

01:54.370 --> 01:57.210
Na tunaweza kugawanya

01:57.210 --> 01:58.200
kwa njia ndefu.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.690
Haitakuwa ndefu sana.

01:59.690 --> 02:01.210
3 kwa 4.

02:01.210 --> 02:02.580
3 inaingia kwa 4 mara moja.

02:02.580 --> 02:04.370
1 mra 3 ni 3.

02:04.370 --> 02:05.250
Unatoa.

02:05.250 --> 02:07.100
4 kutoa 3 ni 1.

02:07.100 --> 02:08.370
Shusha 2.

02:08.370 --> 02:13.110
3 inaingia kwa 12 mara 4.

02:13.110 --> 02:14.710
3 inaingia kwa 42 mara 14.

02:14.710 --> 02:19.230
Kwa hiyo hii hapa inarahisishwa kuwa 14.

02:19.230 --> 02:22.640
Na zimehakikiwa, kwa hiyo tumemaliza.
